From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:10:17 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: a space's pinned tabs fold away under its header,
 like Arc

Clicking the space's name (or Enter/Space on it, or its menu) collapses
the pinned section; the chevron turns and Today stays. The active pinned
tab stays as one row under the header. Remembered per space across
restarts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
